=== fm-extension-binding solo (target) ===
ok - unknown extension conformance section selectors fail before setup
ok - the section coordinator propagates ordered failures and bounded cleanup
not-autohandled: flow-source (left for the handler; still unacknowledged)
ok - one external adapter registers, invokes, captures unhandled evidence, classifies, and terminally retires end to end
ok - inner result.silent host crash releases the parent lifecycle lock before terminal retry
ok - local binding retirement requires its exact identity and disables invocation
ok - ownerless readiness recovers only dead exact-token groups and refuses unsafe or unproved ownership
ok - reconcile durably announces cleanup uncertainty once and recovers both extension sources
not ok - an isolated extension conformance section failed
exit=1
